<p><b>Recordings:</b> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/IEEEDATA.2025.3566012">Torabi Y, Shirani S, Reilly JP. Descriptor: Heart and Lung Sounds Dataset Recorded from a Clinical Manikin using Digital Stethoscope (HLS-CMDS). IEEE Data Descriptions, 2025.</a> Data from <a href="https://zenodo.org/records/15376628">Zenodo</a>, licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Changes made here: exact duplicate files removed, one mislabelled file left out, loudness evened out with one volume change per file, files converted from WAV to MP3, and waveform outlines generated. Labels are the dataset authors'.</p>
<p>These are recordings of a clinical teaching manikin, not patients. For learning only, not for diagnosing patients. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a>. Progress is saved in this browser only.</p>
